# Isolated Base Sepolia only. Never put these values in production wrangler.toml
# or in the Cloudflare Worker settings for orb-studio.
#
# Do not set CDP_API_KEY_ID or CDP_API_KEY_SECRET here. This harness refuses to
# start when either is present, so a Coinbase JWT cannot be sent to PayAI.
# Do not set X402_PAY_TO to the production recipient in wrangler.toml.
# Use a new disposable address. PayAI credits are counted per receiving address.
#
# X402_NETWORK must stay eip155:84532. eip155:8453 is Base mainnet.
X402_NETWORK=eip155:84532
X402_FACILITATOR_URL=https://facilitator.payai.network
X402_PRICE_USD=0.01
X402_PAY_TO=
